  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rocco Cirelli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:59:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:59:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I'm trying to reach the school department. About a early dismissal thing. Is this them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:59:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, no, I'm afraid this is the City Clerk's office at City Hall. The school department is a separate office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:59:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh boy. Really? Sorry about that. I must've hit the wrong number off the website. I'm sorry, I'm all thumbs today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:59:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, it happens. If you look up the Newport school department, they have their own main line. I don't have it in front of me, so it's best to go through their page directly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:59:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so not the city, the school side. Got it. I thought they were all the same, you know, under one roof."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:59:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Different offices. Different phones, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:59:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Sorry again. I'm an assistant manager at a store and it is wicked busy in here today, with the rain, everybody's coming in. I'm doing about four things at once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:00:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Good luck with the rest of your afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:00:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Owen. You too."
    }
  ],
